  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "Mario Woods, a former guard at a nuclear weapons base who says he was abducted, underwent regression hypnosis, a session meant to bring back buried memories, paid for by a man named Jared Tarbell. The researcher Robert Hastings, who studies UFOs at nuclear bases, tells Michels that Tarbell was his benefactor and funded it. Woods says himself that the hypnotist Bob Upton did the session in Brunswick, Georgia, working from Hastings' list of questions, and that workers were replacing the roof, but he never heard \"a single air gun going off,\" which is how he knew he was truly hypnotized."
